    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i just feel like everything i touch gets messed up. my family, my friends... i can see it in their faces. i'm just a constant weight on everyone i care about. i love them so much but i think i'm just making their lives harder just by being in them. it feels like there's no way to fix the damage i've already done.",
