      "content": "The desire to relieve their burden is rooted in a deep, misguided sense of responsibility for their happiness. But truly, your existence is not a problem; it is a complex part of the tapestry of your life, and the idea of \"stopping\" doesn't solve their exhaustion. A real release for them wouldn't be your absence, but seeing you find a path to peace, even if it's a difficult one. Please, let someone else help you carry this impossible weight instead of trying to shoulder it all alone.",
